Supplier: ellipse "Supplier" fit
arrow "materials" "" fit

Procurement: box "Procurement" fit
arrow
Production: box "Production" fit
arrow
Warehouse: box "Warehouse" fit

arrow "products" "" fit
Distributor: ellipse "Distributor" fit
arrow "delivery" "" fit
Consumer: ellipse "Consumer" fit

Finance: box "Finance" at (1/2<Procurement,Warehouse>, 1 below 1/2<Procurement,Warehouse>) wid (Warehouse.e.x-Procurement.w.x)
arrow <-> from Finance to Procurement chop
arrow <-> from Finance to Production chop
arrow <-> from Finance to Warehouse chop

Company: box ht (Procurement.n.y-Finance.s.y)+0.6 wid (Warehouse.e.x-Procurement.w.x)+0.6 \
    at (1/2<Procurement,Warehouse>, 1/2<Procurement,Finance>) fill 0xf5f5f5 behind Supplier
"Company" bold at 0.17 below 1/2<Company.nw,Company.ne>
